            </p>
        </div>

        <div class="card project">
            <h3>Selenium Automation</h3>
            <p>
                Web automation testing project using Selenium WebDriver
                and TestNG.
            </p>
        </div>

        <div class="card project">
            <h3>Java Projects</h3>
            <p>
                Java projects covering OOP, inheritance, method
                overriding and other programming concepts.
            </p>
        </div>

    </div>
</section>

<section id="contact">
    <h2>Contact Me</h2>

    <div class="card contact">
        <p>Email: your-email@example.com</p>
        <p>GitHub: your-github</p>
        <p>LinkedIn: your-linkedin</p>
    </div>
</section>

